Pulpex Weekly 
A Weekly Newsletter Covering the Pulp Futures Market No.204, November 19-23 2001 
Comment 
The NBSK November 2001 contract expired at $399.75. 
83 contracts, 1992 tonnes, went to delivery. 
The NBSK December 2001 contract closed up $2.00 at 
$408.00/tonne . Total volume of NBSK futures traded was 226 
lots. 
The BEK November contract expired at $395.50. 
18 contracts, 432 tonnes, went to delivery. 
The BEK December 2001 contract closed down $2.00 at 
$397.00/tonne . Total volume of BEK futures traded was 36 lots.       
